    rdf:value """Hotel du Dauphin. Rouen. Nov. 29. 1894
Arrived from Munich and met B.B. here at 12. We saw and enjoyed to the full St Ouen, and then talked and talked. 
Hotel Vouillemont. Paris. Friday Nov. 30. 1894  
Came up to lunch with Berty and talked all day. Berty and B.B. made friends, I hope. Jonathan Sturges came to call in the afternoon. I saw Berty off for England by the 9 o’clock train.
3 rue de Beaume. Paris. Saturday Dec. 1. 1894
Moved over here to cheaper quarters, B.B. at the Hotel Voltaire. Spent a really rapturous morning in the Louvre.
Sunday, Dec. 2. 94. Paris 
Notre Dame and the Russian Church in the morning, and this concert in the afternoon. A lyric day. The weather is marvellous. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 74 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1894-95> .

